@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### Response headers added by middleware: x-request-id, x-response-time, x-content-type-options, cache-control
GET {{base}}/rooms

### Client-provided request id is kept; problem gets instance + requestId
GET {{base}}/rooms/abc
X-Request-Id: my-trace-123

### Compression
GET {{base}}/rooms
Accept-Encoding: gzip

### CORS preflight from an allowed origin
OPTIONS {{base}}/rooms
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: content-type

### CORS from a not allowed origin – no access-control-allow-origin in the response
GET {{base}}/rooms
Origin: http://evil.example
